# U33: the constructor's layout at 1280 virtual px (allflame_exp_001): the slot chain under the
# set selector and the trade button (collapsed swap/abyssal slots, hidden Ring 3 and grafts), the
# weapon set buttons, the passive tree selector and the jewel sockets, the item list, the
# "Import from:" selector (the tab is under 980 px high: one DB at a time), the craft/create
# buttons, the tip, the shared item list, and both scroll bars (the content is wider and higher
# than the tab). Hover the Helmet slot (its tooltip) and jewel socket #1 (the socket viewer
# stand-in); wheel the tab down and up (L1499-1515); press the weapon set buttons "II" and "I"
# (L236-275: useSecondWeaponSet, AddUndoState, buildFlag: a recalc through the bridge; the swap
# slots replace the weapon slots, the `locked` states flip), snapshotting each; switch the DB
# selector to "Rare Templates" (the rare DB replaces the unique DB, L297-308).
#! u33-expect ^7slot Helmet db nil
#! u33-expect ^7viewer 17
#! u33-expect undo: 2
fixture userdir=../../fixtures/user1
frames 2
load-build "Builds/allflame_exp_001.xml"
frames 2
key-down CTRL
press 3
key-up CTRL
